    id 475
    label "tWBVne180Mg"
    step 0
    date "2021-10-15T18:45:05Z"
    title "Costa Ricas Vaccine Mandate - A Calm Chat with CostaRicaMatt"
    description "On October 13, 2021, the Costa Rica government announced that it plans to oblige everyone to show proof of vaccination against COVID-19 prior to entering a huge range of establishments.&#10;&#10;Of course, this created a huge uproar among expats and everyone who wants to move to Costa Rica, as well as the anti-vaccine community here in Costa Rica. How could the Costa Rica government possibly do this?!?! I thought Costa Rica was a place where they would never force me to get a vaccine!?!?&#10;&#10;To be clear --- I DO NOT WANT TO EXPRESS APPROVAL OR DISAPPROVAL OF ANYTHING DONE BY THE GOVERNMENT. I also do not mean to express an opinion on whether COVID-19 is real, whether we need vaccines or whether RNA technology is something I even care to understand.&#10;&#10;Let's have some LEVEL-HEADED discussion about some important points surrounding this decree. First and foremost, the Costa Rica government's move should not have surprised anyone who understands their health system philosophy and how they've reacted to the COVID-19 crisis.&#10;&#10;Additionally, let's remember that the October 13 announcement was a presidential decree -- and in Costa Rica, that is VERY far from becoming any kind of real law or rule. There will be a huge difference between the nightmare that people imagined when they heard the announcement yesterday and what will actually happen in December.&#10;&#10;Remember, the government modifies, walks back on, or completely scraps all kinds of decrees and laws. AND, also remember, in Costa Rica, &#34;law enforcement&#34; can be described as &#34;lax at best&#34; on a number of fronts. I personally will be shocked if, come December 1, the government here is suddenly capable and interested in enforcing every single law they have on the books!&#10;&#10;Again, let's keep this conversation level-headed. I just want to provide context; frankly I'll leave comments on just to allow Google juice to help my video post, but when I see the inevitable abuse I'll start banning people.&#10;&#10;#CostaRicaMatt&#10;#CostaRicaChat&#10;#CostaRicaVaccines"
    channeltitle "Costa Rica Matt"
    channelid "UCYVBFNLGdaKGv9jQ16qLsMQ"
